spans.s:
ind.
A preposition and prefix to words, corresponding to off, from, down from, out, away, &c. and implying;
1

 Nourishing.
As
अवगन्तुं
To go away;
अवज्ञातुं
To disrespect;
अवतरितुं
To come down, to descend;
अवस्थातुं
To remain in or on;
अवहर्त्तुं
To take off or away;
also
अवमः
a low man;
अवाक्
reverse, behind;
अवकोकिलः
a koïl with a bad voice, &c.
